        <a href="https://jbpt.de/#contact" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Contact</a>
        <a href="https://jbpt.de/legal/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Legal Notice / Impressum</a>
        <a href="https://jbpt.de/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Data Privacy / Datenschutz</a>
